                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "678c0578-a5a1-3ce1-9af5-549948f72d4b",
                                        "entry_id": "bba3d5b5-da41-3e22-8811-16af63296cf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A condition that is assumed to be true without further evaluation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4137bdec-e76b-40d5-8a85-c68844183519",
                                                "sense_id": "678c0578-a5a1-3ce1-9af5-549948f72d4b",
                                                "text": "When evaluating this math problem, don't forget to read the givens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "given",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16c9d453-dea0-3e48-9ff9-32073876ac5c",
                                        "entry_id": "52001f33-47d0-3093-94d5-621fe25e7f17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Already arranged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3362d7d4-7d7c-4564-a316-2b238cec5594",
                                                "sense_id": "16c9d453-dea0-3e48-9ff9-32073876ac5c",
                                                "text": "If eventually we can't make it at the given time, we'll phone you to let you know, don't worry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83fd69d3-e047-3b38-82f5-fa7d7283b7f9",
                                        "entry_id": "52001f33-47d0-3093-94d5-621fe25e7f17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Currently discussed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fb8d247-81f5-3f28-ae05-e64ae18a4e57",
                                        "entry_id": "52001f33-47d0-3093-94d5-621fe25e7f17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Particular, specific."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61838623-26fd-4414-bd24-2f72e25b59b4",
                                                "sense_id": "5fb8d247-81f5-3f28-ae05-e64ae18a4e57",
                                                "text": "No more than three people can be in that space at a given time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e856189-033a-344a-8662-4d8b3cf5174a",
                                        "entry_id": "52001f33-47d0-3093-94d5-621fe25e7f17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Assumed as fact or hypothesis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbb240bb-e989-4fdf-9ba7-7e6579255e20",
                                                "sense_id": "5e856189-033a-344a-8662-4d8b3cf5174a",
                                                "text": "Given that we will get the resources, what do we want to achieve?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38b13017-87d6-3131-8f75-38109c5473a5",
                                        "entry_id": "52001f33-47d0-3093-94d5-621fe25e7f17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prone, disposed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "with to"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef9fc0e7-3de0-4c69-ab8d-7e58e61b67cc",
                                                "sense_id": "38b13017-87d6-3131-8f75-38109c5473a5",
                                                "text": "He was given to taking a couple of glasses of port at his club."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7151d5be-6adf-4429-b0ed-ba8ea3e8cded",
                        "source_entry_id": "fb3f57be-143d-337d-bcad-4f6715522787",
                        "source_sense_id": "f010d16c-38f3-3c0d-a326-70beeb7d0c48",
                        "target_lang_word": "apt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b41e8253-7100-3ccd-b4c6-d306c59ad434",
                                        "entry_id": "03723946-a1c1-312a-bb9d-8271ed76214f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suitable; appropriate; fit or fitted; suited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b26c89e2-6334-4bf6-8d77-14e70cb04855",
                                                "sense_id": "b41e8253-7100-3ccd-b4c6-d306c59ad434",
                                                "text": "an apt metaphor"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8bdafcd1-2735-4f9d-9a03-d8d3a7c95da8",
                                                "sense_id": "b41e8253-7100-3ccd-b4c6-d306c59ad434",
                                                "text": "apt punishment"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f7b4809-fa77-48cd-9d48-0bc0b30fdf23",
                                                "sense_id": "b41e8253-7100-3ccd-b4c6-d306c59ad434",
                                                "text": "a river […] apt to be forded by a lamb"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c858483-7d47-45e4-913a-5206ed92d5ce",
                                                "sense_id": "b41e8253-7100-3ccd-b4c6-d306c59ad434",
                                                "text": "While we to Jove the pure libations pay, / Than Jove what apter claims the hallow'd lay?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3618fe13-698a-3c0e-afdf-799e81b60111",
                                        "entry_id": "03723946-a1c1-312a-bb9d-8271ed76214f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a habitual tendency; habitually liable or likely; disposed towards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of persons or things"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3646e27a-ca51-47c1-b920-f307c3cbbaa3",
                                                "sense_id": "3618fe13-698a-3c0e-afdf-799e81b60111",
                                                "text": "that lofty pity with which prosperous folk are apt to remember their grandfathers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9a19496-5b3b-449f-a52f-7a068f19a1be",
                                                "sense_id": "3618fe13-698a-3c0e-afdf-799e81b60111",
                                                "text": "This tree, if unprotected, is apt to be stripped of its leaves by a leaf-cutting ant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "663accc6-597a-4b1c-aa89-1a4a9ea94916",
                                                "sense_id": "3618fe13-698a-3c0e-afdf-799e81b60111",
                                                "text": "Since sick people were apt to be present, he could not always depend on a lively young crowd in the same ward with him, and the entertainment was not always good."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd848cfd-814f-4ca6-a49b-4850aff7f574",
                                                "sense_id": "3618fe13-698a-3c0e-afdf-799e81b60111",
                                                "text": "On Wednesday night, a federal judge issued a preliminary injunction against a new California law that makes physicians subject to professional discipline for sharing COVID-19 \"misinformation\" with their patients. U.S. District Judge William B. Shubb concluded that California's definition of misinformation is unconstitutionally vague, failing to give doctors fair notice of which conduct the statute covers, which is a basic requirement of due process. That vagueness is especially problematic in this context, Shubb said, because it is apt to have a chilling effect on speech protected by the First Amendment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "762fb0a0-bbcc-3ba8-8dbc-0164a192f9b1",
                                        "entry_id": "03723946-a1c1-312a-bb9d-8271ed76214f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ready; especially fitted or qualified (to do something); quick to learn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97789bda-9272-4ae7-93fb-2cb6731b586a",
                                                "sense_id": "762fb0a0-bbcc-3ba8-8dbc-0164a192f9b1",
